---
export const prerender = true;
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import shrineSetups from "../data/shrineSetups.json";
const visibleSetups = ["Setup B"];
const shrineSetupGroups = shrineSetups.filter((setup: any) => visibleSetups.includes(setup.label));
---

<Base title="Tips | Motto Immortal">

  <PageHero
    tag="Tips"
    headline="Tips"
    subtitle="Beginner tips and shrine system breakdowns"
  />
<div class="page-wrapper">
  <!-- TAB BAR -->
  <div class="main-tabs">
    <button class="main-tab is-active" data-tab="beginner">Beginner</button>
    <button class="main-tab" data-tab="shrine">Shrine</button>
  </div>

  <!-- ====================================================
       TAB: BEGINNER (default)
       ==================================================== -->
  <div id="tab-beginner" class="main-tab-panel">
    <main class="eg-main-content">

      <!-- F2P NOTE -->
      <div class="eg-content-card eg-note-card">
        <p>
          This guide is written from a <strong>F2P and low-spender perspective</strong>.
          If you are a whale or have heavily starred heroes, you can replace
          the suggested heroes below with your own star picks.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- CORE RULE -->
      <div class="eg-content-card eg-core-rule-card">
        <h2>The Core Rule of the Game</h2>
        <p>You are <strong>not</strong> building 5 equal heroes.</p>
        <div class="core-rule-split">
          <div class="core-rule-carry">
            <div class="core-rule-label">1-2 Carries</div>
            <p>Deal the damage. Get the gear, the relics, the investment.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="core-rule-support">
            <div class="core-rule-label">3-4 Supports</div>
            <p>Give the carry energy, buffs, and uptime. They exist to enable the carry.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="eg-team-example">
          <p>Example: if Hecate is your carry, your four supports give her energy, healing, and buffs. The team exists to make her ultimate hit harder, more often.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- GAME PHASES -->
      <div class="eg-content-card">
        <h2>What Phase Are You In?</h2>
        <p>Know your phase so you invest resources in the right place:</p>
        <div class="phase-grid">
          <div class="phase-card phase-early">
            <div class="phase-label">Early</div>
            <div class="phase-desc">1 team - focus on building one strong core before spreading resources.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="phase-card phase-mid">
            <div class="phase-label">Mid</div>
            <div class="phase-desc">2 to 3 teams - start specializing for PvE bosses, Odyssey, and PvP.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="phase-card phase-late">
            <div class="phase-label">Late</div>
            <div class="phase-desc">4 to 5 teams - optimized rosters, relic breakpoints, and event-driven upgrades.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="eg-team-example">
          <p><strong>Key idea:</strong> Build a strong PvE core first. PvE unlocks the resources that make everything else easier.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- EARLY GAME PRIORITIES -->
      <div class="eg-content-card">
        <h2>Early Game Priorities</h2>
        <h3>1 - Push Odyssey (Campaign) for Undying Flame</h3>
        <p><strong>Undying Flame</strong> is the most important early progression item - it upgrades your Shrine, which increases long-term account power and farming efficiency.</p>
        <h3>2 - Compete in Torment Rift for Calamity Tier</h3>
        <p><strong>Calamity Tier</strong> rewards upgrade your <strong>Beacon Tree</strong>, granting account-wide stat bonuses to all heroes. Beacon bonuses apply in every game mode and never become wasted investment.</p>
        <h3>3 - Focus Gear on Your Top Two DPS</h3>
        <p>Gear priority order:</p>
        <ol class="gear-priority-list">
          <li><strong>Main DPS</strong> - gets everything first</li>
          <li><strong>Secondary DPS</strong> - gets the rest</li>
          <li><strong>Tank</strong> - benefits from gear but is not the first priority</li>
          <li><strong>Supports</strong> - rely less on stats, gear last</li>
        </ol>
        <p>Spreading gear evenly across six heroes is one of the most common early mistakes.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- STAR HEROES -->
      <div class="eg-content-card">
        <h2>Star Heroes - Who to Prioritize at 1 Copy?</h2>
        <p>Some legendary heroes deliver immediate value at base copy (no extra copies needed), while others need heavy duplication investment before they contribute meaningfully.</p>
        <div class="star-split">
          <div class="star-box star-good">
            <div class="star-box-title">Good at Base Copy</div>
            <p class="star-box-note">Provide immediate value and do not require extra copies to contribute.</p>
            <div class="hero-chip-grid">
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/nuwa">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/nuwa.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Nuwa</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/amunra">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/amunra.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Amun Ra</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/nyx">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/nyx.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Nyx</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/dionysus">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/dionysus.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Dionysus</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/cronus">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/cronus.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Chronos</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="star-box star-invest">
            <div class="star-box-title">Need Heavy Investment</div>
            <p class="star-box-note">Hold off until you have the resources to fully build them.</p>
            <div class="hero-chip-grid">
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/zeus">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/zeus.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Zeus</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/nezha">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/nezha.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Nezha</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FRONTLINERS -->
      <div class="eg-content-card" id="frontliners">
        <h2>Frontliners to Build First</h2>
        <p>Frontliners are usually Tank and Warrior class heroes. Some Supports like Caishen and Mengpo can also serve as frontliners depending on your comp.</p>
        <h3>Core Frontliners</h3>
        <div class="hero-chip-grid">
          <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/heracles">
            <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/heracles.webp')"></div>
            <span class="hero-chip-name">Heracles</span>
          </a>
          <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/poseidon">
            <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/poseidon.webp')"></div>
            <span class="hero-chip-name">Poseidon</span>
          </a>
          <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/momus">
            <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/momus.webp')"></div>
            <span class="hero-chip-name">Momus</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="eg-team-example">
          <p><strong>Note on Poseidon:</strong> He needs Relic Level 10 to justify a frontline slot. Below that threshold he underperforms - see the Relic Priority section below.</p>
          <p><strong>Note on Heracles:</strong> He functions as a bruiser carry, not a pure tank. His damage output is a core part of his value, so gear and invest him accordingly.</p>
        </div>
        <h3>Strong Frontliners</h3>
        <div class="hero-chip-grid">
          <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/hladgunnr">
            <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/hladgunnr.webp')"></div>
            <span class="hero-chip-name">Hladgunnr</span>
          </a>
          <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/nuba">
            <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/nuba.webp')"></div>
            <span class="hero-chip-name">Nuba</span>
          </a>
          <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/bastet">
            <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/bastet.webp')"></div>
            <span class="hero-chip-name">Bastet</span>
          </a>
          <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/khepri">
            <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/khepri.webp')"></div>
            <span class="hero-chip-name">Khepri</span>
          </a>
          <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/set">
            <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/set.webp')"></div>
            <span class="hero-chip-name">Set</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <h3>Situational Frontliners</h3>
        <div class="hero-chip-grid">
          <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/prometheus">
            <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/prometheus.webp')"></div>
            <span class="hero-chip-name">Prometheus</span>
          </a>
          <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/jormungandr">
            <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/jormungandr.webp')"></div>
            <span class="hero-chip-name">Jormungandr</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="eg-team-example">
          <p>Warrior heroes like Nezha and Hladgunnr can also function as damage dealers depending on your team composition.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- DAMAGE DEALERS -->
      <div class="eg-content-card" id="damage-dealers">
        <h2>Damage Dealers to Build First</h2>
        <p>Damage dealers (DDs) are usually Archer, Assassin, and Mage class heroes. Warriors like Nezha and Hladgunnr can also fill the DD role.</p>
        <div class="phase-row-grid">
          <div class="phase-row">
            <div class="phase-row-label early-label">Early to Mid</div>
            <div class="hero-chip-grid">
              <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/isis">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/isis.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Isis</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/fengyi">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/fengyi.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Fengyi</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/nemesis">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/nemesis.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Nemesis</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="phase-row">
            <div class="phase-row-label late-label">Mid to Late</div>
            <div class="hero-chip-grid">
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/skadi">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/skadi.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Skadi</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/hecate">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/hecate.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Hecate</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/anubis">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/anubis.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Anubis</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/bastet">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/bastet.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Bastet</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/phoenix">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/phoenix.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Phoenix</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/jingwei">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/jingwei.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Jingwei</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/hela">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/hela.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Hela</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- SUPPORT HEROES -->
      <div class="eg-content-card" id="supports">
        <h2>Support Heroes to Build First</h2>
        <p>Support heroes are usually the Support class, but heroes from other classes like Set and Diana can fill support roles effectively.</p>
        <div class="support-tiers">
          <div class="support-tier">
            <div class="support-tier-label">Priority 1</div>
            <div class="hero-chip-grid">
              <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/mengpo">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/mengpo.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Mengpo</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/caishen">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/caishen.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Caishen</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/yuelao">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/yuelao.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Yuelao</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="support-tier">
            <div class="support-tier-label">Priority 2</div>
            <div class="hero-chip-grid">
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/tefnut">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/tefnut.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Tefnut</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/pan">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/pan.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Pan</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/cancer">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/cancer.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Cancer</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="support-tier">
            <div class="support-tier-label">Priority 3</div>
            <div class="hero-chip-grid">
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/athena">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/athena.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Athena</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/set">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/set.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Set</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/diana">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/diana.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Diana</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="diana-dionysus-box">
          <h3>Diana vs Dionysus - Which to Build First?</h3>
          <div class="dd-split">
            <div class="dd-card dd-beginner">
              <div class="dd-label">Diana - Beginner Friendly</div>
              <p>Restores energy to allies, which means your carry uses their ultimate more often. Simple, consistent, and effective in any team.</p>
              <p class="dd-tag">Good as your first energy support pick.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="dd-card dd-advanced">
              <div class="dd-label">Dionysus - Advanced</div>
              <p>Increases attack speed, boosting damage indirectly. More powerful in optimized teams where the carry already has energy covered.</p>
              <p class="dd-tag">Better once your team has a strong rotation established.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- WISH LIST -->
      <div class="eg-content-card" id="wish-list">
        <h2>Wish List - Your Free Early Picks</h2>
        <p>The Wish List lets you influence which hero you pull in each faction. Pick wrong and your gold pinions feed the wrong hero. These are the recommended F2P picks per faction:</p>
        <div class="wishlist-grid">

          <div class="wishlist-faction">
            <div class="wishlist-faction-label">Hearts</div>
            <div class="hero-chip-grid">
              <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/caishen">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/caishen.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Caishen</span>
              </a>
              <span class="chip-divider">or</span>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/yuelao">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/yuelao.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Yuelao</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <p class="wishlist-note">Caishen first - energy support that slots into any team. Yuelao if you already have Caishen - best all-in-one support in the game.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wishlist-faction">
            <div class="wishlist-faction-label">Spades</div>
            <div class="hero-chip-grid">
              <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/hecate">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/hecate.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Hecate</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <p class="wishlist-note">The Spades main carry. Scales from weak to strong at Relic 10. Essential for Delusion's Den long-term.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wishlist-faction">
            <div class="wishlist-faction-label">Diamonds</div>
            <div class="hero-chip-grid">
              <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/phoenix">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/phoenix.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Phoenix</span>
              </a>
              <span class="chip-divider">or</span>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/sekhmet">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/sekhmet.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Sekhmet</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <p class="wishlist-note">Phoenix for Torment Rift (infinite revive at higher relic levels) and sustained carry use. Sekhmet if you want a single-target melee carry instead.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="wishlist-faction">
            <div class="wishlist-faction-label">Clubs</div>
            <div class="hero-chip-grid">
              <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/fengyi">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/fengyi.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Fengyi</span>
              </a>
              <span class="chip-divider">or</span>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/demeter">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/demeter.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Demeter</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <p class="wishlist-note">Fengyi as the Clubs AoE carry. Demeter if you need a tank for your comp.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- TEAM COMPOSITIONS -->
      <div class="eg-content-card" id="team-comps">
        <h2>Team Compositions</h2>
        <p>These are solid starting compositions to build toward. Mix and match based on which heroes you have available.</p>
        <p><strong>Note on Meret:</strong> She can function as a control-focused carry, not only as a support piece. In the comps below she appears in protective shells, but she is also viable as your primary damage dealer when properly invested.</p>
        <div class="comp-list">

          <div class="comp-card">
